Chapter: StoryGraphDemo
  cites Explorer chapter StoryGraph

 Proof: spin a story graph (key frames + branch possibilities) from a seed,
 using NameForge names throughout.

 We say:

  demo-text : Integer -> Text
  demo-text (x) =
    "==== Seed 42, Hero's Journey, Save the captive ====\n" & format-story (forge-story-as 42 HerosJourney Rescue) & "\n"
    & "==== Same world (42) as a Tragedy, Find lost kin ====\n" & format-story (forge-story-as 42 Tragedy FindKin) & "\n"
    & "==== Same world (42), Overcoming the Monster, Slay the villain ====\n" & format-story (forge-story-as 42 OvercomingMonster Slay)

  opening : [Console] None = act
    print-line-uni (demo-text 0)
  end
